# Build a Functional AI Creative Writing App Called Plotline

## 1. Project Overview

Build a beautiful, fully functional, responsive AI-powered creative writing application called **Plotline**.

**Tagline:** Where stories take shape.

Plotline is a creative writing studio for novelists, screenwriters, fanfiction writers, and narrative game designers who want to develop complex stories with AI assistance without losing creative control.

The app should combine the organizational capabilities of Notion, the story-development features of dedicated writing software, and the conversational flexibility of an AI writing assistant.

Its defining feature is its ability to distinguish between **established story canon, hypothetical ideas, abandoned concepts, and newly approved narrative developments**.

The core problem Plotline solves is that writers who brainstorm with AI often explore dozens of different story directions, only for the AI to eventually confuse abandoned ideas with established facts, forget character details, contradict earlier decisions, or treat speculative brainstorming as finalized story canon.

Plotline should give writers a dedicated creative environment where they can explore freely while maintaining full control over what becomes part of their story.

This must be a genuinely working application, not merely a static UI concept or clickable mockup.

I want to be able to use the app myself, create projects, save information, edit characters, generate AI suggestions, experiment with plot branches, and return to my work after refreshing the page.

